<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Anchor Gaming raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Anchor Gaming raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bankers Trust said it raised the rating on Anchor Gaming to buy from market perform.</p>
<p>-- &quot;confident&quot; that company will proceed with expansion at Colorado Central Station Casino in Black Hawk, Colo.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 1-3/8 to 43-1/4.</p>
</text>
